      "side": 1,
      "message": "+1 on removing the magic numbers which are associated with Android. \n\nHowever, I don\u0027t think we need necessarily a custom message. I think keeping status (or `error_code`) is fine, if we define it by either `0x00` for success or a valid error code from the spec for the request. Then, we could simply declare constants in both `Gatt.kt` (and map Android error codes to them here) and `gatt.py`.",
